[{sequence:range '1..8'}{pad:echo sequence:prime(9 - $sequence)/} {/sequence:range}][{pad:echo sequence:prime(3)/} {pad:echo sequence:prime(20)/} {pad:echo sequence:prime(2)/}][{pad:echo sequence:add(3, 10)/} {pad:echo sequence:add(3, 20)/} {pad:echo sequence:add(2)/}][{sequence:range '1..3', push='s'}{/sequence:range}{pad:echo sequence:add(2, 's')/} {pad:resume multiply=10/}{pad:echo sequence:add(2, 's')/}][{pad:echo sequence:fibonacci(10)/} {pad:echo sequence:fibonacci(5)/} {pad:echo sequence:lucas(5)/}]
